  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你是否曾經在咀嚼某些本來應該<strong>喝</strong>的食物（例如甜菜根湯）時感到牙痛？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">這個輕量模組提供了一個「drinkit:drinkable」物品標籤，其中的物品將以飲用動畫進行消耗。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">已預先為標籤設定 3 種原版食物。若想新增自訂項目，只需依循該格式即可。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">注意：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:terminal, monaco, monospace\">你<span style=\"color:#9c0\"><strong>絕對可以</strong></span>將此模組加入你的模組包中。</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
